# Janitor Sidecar 二进制文件目录
# 
# 此目录存放打包后的 Janitor 可执行文件
# 文件命名格式: janitor-{target-triple}
#
# 支持的平台:
# - janitor-aarch64-apple-darwin      (macOS ARM64)
# - janitor-x86_64-apple-darwin       (macOS Intel)
# - janitor-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.exe (Windows x64)
# - janitor-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu  (Linux x64)
#
# 构建方法:
#   cd echo/sidecar/janitor
#   python build_sidecar.py
